# Portfolio stack

- Package manager: **pnpm** only
- Framework: Next.js App Router + TypeScript
- Styling: Tailwind CSS v4; UI primitives from shadcn/ui (Nova preset) under `src/components/ui/`
- Theming: `next-themes` for light/dark
- Prefer matching existing patterns in `src/components/` and `src/app/` over introducing new abstractions
- Before changing Next.js APIs, read the installed docs under `node_modules/next/dist/docs/`
